# Exponential Desktop's factory toasts (#EDE-12): the shell is the session's
# org.freedesktop.Notifications server; a new notification opens this on-demand top-right layer
# surface and the newest three show as cards until they expire (the app's timeout, else 6 s; critical
# ones stay) or are closed. /notifications/toasts holds them newest first; every card may close
# (ede_notify_close) or press one of the app's actions (ede_notify_action {id, key}: each action
# carries its toast's id, as a template item reads only its own fields and the root, #EDE-196). The
# app's `default` action is no button: a press on the card itself is it (ede_notify_open, the bell
# row's press: the app hears `default` when it gave one, then the notification closes). #EDE-65: a new
# unread Exponential inbox entry of a signed-in account toasts the same way (its actions Open and Mark
# read; its close only hides the toast, the entry stays in the bell). The whole history is the panel's
# bell (notification-center.express).
surface("notifications", extensions={ede: {layer: "top", anchor: ["top", "right"], size: {width: 380, height: 420}, margin: {top: 8, right: 8}, onDemand: true, functions: ["ede_notify_open", "ede_notify_close", "ede_notify_action"]}})
$/notifications/count = 0
$/notifications/list = []
$/notifications/toasts = []
root = Stack(direction="vertical", gap="sm", align="stretch", children=_template($/notifications/toasts, toast, key="id"))
toast = Box(style={display: "flex", flexDirection: "column", gap: "$spacing.xs", padding: "$spacing.sm", backgroundColor: "$color.popover", borderWidth: 1, borderColor: "$color.border", borderRadius: "$radius.md"}, children=[toast_head, toast_summary, toast_body, toast_actions], on={press: ede_notify_open(id=$id)})
toast_head = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="sm", align="center", children=[toast_icon, toast_app, toast_at, toast_close])
toast_icon = Image(src=$icon, alt=$app, fit="contain", width=20, height=20, fallback="nav-notifications")
toast_app = Text(text=$app, variant="caption", lines=1, style={flexGrow: 1})
toast_at = Text(text=$at, variant="muted")
toast_close = Button(label="Close", icon="ui-close", variant="ghost", size="icon", on={press: ede_notify_close(id=$id, toast=true)})
toast_summary = Text(text=$summary, variant="label", lines=2)
toast_body = Text(text=$body, variant="muted", lines=3, visible=not(value=eq(a=$body, b="")))
toast_actions = Stack(direction="horizontal", gap="xs", wrap=true, children=_template($actions, toast_action, key="key"))
toast_action = Button(label=$label, variant="outline", size="sm", on={press: ede_notify_action(id=$id, key=$key)})
